@(Theomachado)I appreciate the transparency you brought to the table, all i wanted to say is that we humans should not delegate the responsibility of thinking to LLMs. Maybe this would workout in short term but in the long run this is just complete disaster for us, writing is a form of therapy, when we write we are forced to think about the subject and in that process we create something new or valuable, i think this process is vital for a healthy and thriving mind.&#x20;

Anyways, i upvoted all of your comments.&#x20;

Thank you.&#x20;
